# Frames
# Order is critical:
#   1. SlotProvider.lua sets up the trivial provider (returns "boss"..i).
#   2. SodSlotProvider.lua OVERRIDES it with a target+nameplate scanner —
#      THIS is the file that makes the addon work on Classic Era, where
#      boss1..5 unit IDs don't exist.
#   3. Boss/CastBar/Auras then capture BossW.MAX_BOSS as upvalue and call
#      BossW.SlotProvider:* through the indirection.
Frames\SlotProvider.lua
Frames\SodSlotProvider.lua
Frames\MyAuras.lua
Frames\Boss.lua
Frames\CastBar.lua
Frames\Auras.lua

